# Every comment form of the language, then a negative end
** spec: lexical/lexical.md#comments
## a subtitle is a comment too
/*------------------------------------------------+
| Block comments span lines and do not nest       |
+-------------------------------------------------*/
driver a02_comments is
  process main is
    ** a note on its own line
    new a = 1 :Integer;      ** a note after code
    new b := a + (** an expression comment **) 2;
    expect b == 3;
    /* a block comment inside a process
       with a second line */
    panic;                   ** forced exit with code 1
  return;
end a02_comments;
/*
   The first closing marker ends a block comment.
   Use ** lines to comment out code that contains comments.
*/
/*@expect
{
  "exit": 1
}
*/
